    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p14_b10",
      "text": "\u2022 MMHalBench (Sun et al., 2024): Following the official protocol, we use GPT-4 (\u2018gpt-4-0613\u2019) to assess the overall\nquality of generated responses on a scale from 0 to 6 and to calculate the final hallucination rate.\n",
      "bbox": [
        66.9,
