      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p14_b11",
      "text": "\u2022 AMBER (Wang et al., 2023): This benchmark consists of two parts. For the Discriminative Task, we report Accuracy\nand F1 scores. For the Generative Task, we use the official evaluation tool to report a CHAIR score variant, object\ncoverage, rate of hallucinated responses, and hallucination rate overlapping with human cognition.\n",
      "bbox": [
        66.9,
        544.68,
        541.79,
        578.57
