      "char_count": 329,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.25036_p14_b12",
      "text": "\u2022 Object HalBench (Rohrbach et al., 2018): Following prior work (Yu et al., 2024b; Wang et al., 2024; Fu et al., 2025),\nwe report both the response-level (CHAIRs) and mention-level (CHAIRi) hallucination rates. Object extraction for this\nmetric is performed using GPT-3.5-Turbo (\u2018gpt-3.5-turbo-0125\u2019).\n",
