      "text": "For LBR, we also provide results from other MLLMs and methods for reference, which are not directly comparable due\nto differences in base models and preference data. These methods and models include GPT-4V (Achiam et al., 2023),\nRLAIF-V (Yu et al., 2024c), CCA-LLaVA (Xing et al., 2024), mDPO (Wang et al., 2024), RLHF-V (Yu et al., 2024b),\nHSA-DPO (Xiao et al., 2024), AMP-MEG (Zhang et al., 2024), HALVA (Sarkar et al., 2025), and OPA-DPO (Yang et al.,\n2025).\n",
